Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 16:39:16 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add gradient direction computation and complete GoogleTest
 suite

- Implement compute_direction() using integer cross-multiplication
  instead of atan2() for embedded-friendly angle quantization
- Quantizes gradient to 4 directions: 0=horizontal, 1=diagonal(/),
  2=vertical, 3=diagonal(\)
- Add GoogleTest unit tests for all pipeline stages:
  Gaussian (2), Sobel (4), Magnitude (2), Direction (3) = 11 tests
- All 11 tests passing on host
